This product includes software derived from TinyLLaVA Factory
(https://github.com/TinyLLaVA/TinyLLaVA_Factory), licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. TRAG modifies the model wrapper, training entry points,
trainer, configuration arguments, and evaluation code to support multimodal
knowledge distillation and token-level response-to-vision attention guidance.

This product also contains implementations of comparison objectives based on
LLaVA-KD and CompoDistill. Their repositories and papers should be cited when
those comparison modes are used.
